:: Pub Dice Minigame Intro
	<<effects>>
	<<generate1>><<generate2>><<generate3>>

	당신은 험상궂어 보이는 <<group>>【이가】 시끄럽게 주사위를 굴리며 노골적으로 서로를 깎아내리고 부추기는 테이블에 다가간다. <<person2>><<person>>【이가】 말없이 기도하며 주사위를 던지지만, 나머지 무리가 그 판을 이겨 환호하는 동안 <<him>>【이가】 큰 소리로 욕을 내뱉는 모습이 보인다.
	<br><br>

	<<person1>><<person>>【이가】 돌아서서 당신을 아래위로 훑어본다. <<his>> 시선에 은근한 굶주림이 어려 있다. <br>
	"한판 하러 온 거야, 아니면 구경만 할 거야?"
	<br><br>

	<<link [[한판 하러 왔다고 말한다|Pub Dice Minigame Intro 2]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[떠난다|Pub]]>><</link>>
	<br>

:: Pub Dice Minigame Intro 2
	<<effects>>

	<<set _diceWeeklyCap to 1000000>>
	<<set _diceWeeklyStake to $weekly.diceWeeklyStake or 0>>
	<<set _diceWeeklyRoom to Math.max(0, _diceWeeklyCap - _diceWeeklyStake)>>

	<<if _diceWeeklyRoom lte 0>>
		앉기도 전에 손 하나가 당신의 어깨를 움켜쥔다. 랜드리다.
		<br><br>

		"오늘은 안 돼." <<nnpc_he "Landry">>【이가】 <<group>>【이가】 당신을 알아채기도 전에 테이블에서 멀리 이끌며 말한다. "이번 주에 이미 이 테이블에 <<printmoney _diceWeeklyStake>>을 쏟아부었잖아. 그런 돈이 오가면 눈에 띄는 법이고, 난 이 모든 게 조용히 유지되길 바라지 머리기사가 되길 바라는 게 아니야."
		<br><br>

		<<nnpc_He "Landry">>【은는】 테이블 쪽을 힐끗 돌아본 뒤 당신을 본다. "일주일만 기다려. 내가 일을 무마하고 아무도 캐묻지 않는다는 걸 확인하면, 그때 다시 와도 돼."
		<br><br>

		<<link [[떠난다|Pub]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $phase to 1>>

		"그래?" <<he>>【이가】 건방진 미소를 번뜩인다. "들었어, 다들? 여기 새 선수가 생긴 모양인데." <<group>>【이가】 크게 웃고, <<person1>><<person>>【이가】 당신에게 의자를 가리킨다. 당신은 앉는다.
		<br><br>

		"그래서..." <<person>>【이가】 테이블 위로 몸을 기울인다. "큰손이야, 아니면 쪼그만 <<bitch>>【이】야?" <<group>>【이가】 당신이 그저 술 취한 부랑아인 줄 알고 노골적으로 비웃는다.
		<br><br>

		"알아 둬." <<he>>【이가】 말을 잇는다. "우리랑 하려면 최소 <<printmoney 50000>>은 있어야 해."
		<br><br>

		이번 주에 당신은 이 테이블에 <<printmoney _diceWeeklyStake>>을 가져왔다. 판이 너무 뜨거워지기 전에 랜드리가 허용하는 한도는 <<printmoney _diceWeeklyCap>>이다.
		<br><br>

		<<if $money gte 50000 and _diceWeeklyRoom gte 50000>>
			<<link [[판에 낀다 (£500)|Pub Dice Minigame]]>><<set $wagerLvl to 0>><<set $money -= 50000>><<set $weekly.diceWeeklyStake to _diceWeeklyStake + 50000>><<set $diceintro to 1>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<if $money gte 100000 and $xchange.gamblingLvl gte 1 and _diceWeeklyRoom gte 100000>>
			<<link [[판에 낀다 (£1000)|Pub Dice Minigame]]>><<set $wagerLvl to 1>><<set $money -= 100000>><<set $weekly.diceWeeklyStake to _diceWeeklyStake + 100000>><<set $diceintro to 1>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<if $money gte 300000 and $xchange.gamblingLvl gte 2 and _diceWeeklyRoom gte 300000>>
			<<link [[판에 낀다 (£3000)|Pub Dice Minigame]]>><<set $wagerLvl to 2>><<set $money -= 300000>><<set $weekly.diceWeeklyStake to _diceWeeklyStake + 300000>><<set $diceintro to 1>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<if $money lt 50000>>
			돈이 부족하다.
		<<elseif _diceWeeklyRoom lt 50000>>
			<span class="red">이 테이블에서 이번 주에 남은 한도는 <<printmoney _diceWeeklyRoom>>뿐이다.</span>
		<</if>>

		<br>
		<<link [[물러난다|Pub]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>

:: Pub Dice Minigame Widgets [widget]

	<<widget "gambling-init">>
		<<set $xchange.pubGamblingEnabled to 1>>
		<<set $xchange.gamblingUpkeepFailed to 0>>
		<<set $xchange.gamblingLvl to 0>>
		<<set $xchange.gamblingEarnings to 0>>
		<<set $weekly.gamblingStartupPeriod to 1>>
		<<set $weekly.gamblingUpkeepPaid to 1>>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "gambling-pay-upkeep">>
		<<set _chosenLvl to Math.clamp(_args[0], 0, 2)>>
		<<set _upkeepLevels to [200000, 400000, 1200000]>>
		<<set $xchange.gamblingLvl to _chosenLvl>>
		<<money `-_upkeepLevels[_chosenLvl]` "pubGambling">>
		<<set $weekly.gamblingUpkeepPaid to 1>>		
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-stake">>
		<<set _stake to [50000,100000,300000][_args.length gt 0 ? _args[0] : $dice.wagerLvl]>>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-log">>
		<<for $dice.log.length gt 0>>
			<<print $dice.log.shift()>><br>
		<</for>>
		<br>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-eventchecks">>

		/* Tick or Trigger drinks event */
		<<if $dice.event.drinkEnabled>>
			<<set $dice.event.pending to 1>>
		<<elseif $dice.event.roundsUntilAlcohol lte 0 and $dice.event.drinkIntro lt 1>>
			<<set $dice.event.drinkIntro to 1>>
		<<else>>
			<<set $dice.event.roundsUntilAlcohol-->>
		<</if>>

		/* Queue up agreed penalty event from loss */
		<<if $dice.event.roundLoss[0]>>
			<<switch $dice.altbet>>
			<<case "a kiss">>
				<<set $dice.event.pending to 1>>
				<<set $dice.event.kiss to 1>>
			<<case "an oral">>
				<<set $dice.event.pending to 1>>
				<<set $dice.event.oral to 1>>
			<<case "your body">>
				<<set $dice.event.pending to 1>>
				<<set $dice.event.sex to 1>>
			<</switch>>

			/* If a garment was staked, queue its forfeit. 
			The slot code is copied into the event object because $dice.altbetClothing is cleared during round cleanup. */
			<<if $dice.altbetClothing isnot undefined>>
				<<set $dice.event.pending to 1>>
				<<set $dice.event.clothing to 1>>
				<<set $dice.event.clothingSlot to $dice.altbetClothing>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>

	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-runevents">>
		<<if $dice.event.pending is 0>>
			<<if $dice.event.drinkIntro is 1>>
				지난 몇 판을 거치며 <<group>>【이가】 이미 충분히 달아올라, 벌칙을 도입해 판을 더 키우기로 했다. 당신의 의견과 상관없이 당신은 다수결에서 밀린다. <span class="purple">이제 진 사람은 벌칙으로 술을 마셔야 한다.</span><br><br>
				<<set $dice.event.drinkIntro to 2>>
				<<set $dice.event.drinkEnabled to 1>>
			<</if>>
			<<set _text_output to "The <<group>> are goading each other, and just being rowdy overall.">>
			<<print _text_output>>
		<<else>>
			<<if $dice.event.kiss>>

				패배를 알아챈 당신은 약속을 지킬 때가 왔다는 걸 안다. <<group>>【이가】 기대에 찬 눈으로 당신을 바라보며, 당신이 약속한 대로 그 판의 승자에게 보상하기를 기다린다.
				<br><br>
				키스를 걸었다. 그리고 <span class="purple">키스는 반드시 건네야 한다</span>.
				<br><br>
				<<link [[키스한다|Pub Dice Minigame Kiss]]>><</link>>
				<br>
				<<link [[거절한다|Pub Dice Minigame Sex]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
				<br>

			<<elseif $dice.event.oral>>
				패배를 알아챈 당신은 약속을 지킬 때가 왔다는 걸 안다. <<group>>【이가】 기대에 찬 눈으로 당신을 바라보며, 당신이 약속한 대로 그 판의 승자에게 보상하기를 기다린다.
				<br><br>
				오럴 섹스를 걸었다. 그리고 <span class="purple">오럴 섹스는 반드시 해야 한다</span>.
				<br><br>

				<<link [[무릎을 꿇는다|Pub Dice Minigame Oral]]>><</link>>
				<br>
				<<link [[거절한다|Pub Dice Minigame Sex]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
				<br>

			<<elseif $dice.event.sex>>
				패배를 알아챈 당신은 약속을 지킬 때가 왔다는 걸 안다. <<group>>【이가】 기대에 찬 눈으로 당신을 바라보며, 당신이 약속한 대로 그 판의 승자에게 보상하기를 기다린다.
				<br><br>
				당신의 몸을 걸었다. 그리고 <span class="purple">당신의 몸을 내놓아야 한다</span>.
				<br><br>
		
				<<saveNPC 0 "dice_npc_1">>
				<<saveNPC 1 "dice_npc_2">>
				<<saveNPC 2 "dice_npc_3">>
				<<endevent>>

				<<set _i to 0>>
				<<for _player range [1,2,3]>>
					<<if $dice.event.roundLoss[_player] is 0>>
						<<loadNPC _i `"dice_npc_"+_player`>>
						<<set _i++>>
					<</if>>
				<</for>>

				<<link [[몸을 내맡긴다|Pub Dice Minigame Sex]]>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>>
				<br>
				<<link [[거절한다|Pub Dice Minigame Sex]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
				<br>

			<<elseif $dice.event.clothing>>
				패배를 알아챈 당신은 무엇을 걸었는지 안다. <<group>>【이가】 씩 웃으며 손을 내밀고, 당신이 내기를 지켜 걸었던 옷을 넘기기를 기대한다.
				<br><br>
				<<switch $dice.event.clothingSlot>>
				<<case 0>>
					당신은 옷 한 벌 전체를 걸었다. <span class="purple">당신의 $worn.upper.name【이가】 벗겨져야 한다</span>.
				<<case 1>>
					당신은 상의를 걸었다. <span class="purple">당신의 $worn.upper.name【이가】 벗겨져야 한다</span>.
				<<case 2>>
					당신은 하의를 걸었다. <span class="purple">당신의 $worn.lower.name【이가】 벗겨져야 한다</span>.
				<<case 3>>
					당신은 속옷 한 벌을 걸었다. <span class="purple">당신의 $worn.under_upper.name【이가】 벗겨져야 한다</span>.
				<<case 4>>
					당신은 속옷 상의를 걸었다. <span class="purple">당신의 $worn.under_upper.name【이가】 벗겨져야 한다</span>.
				<<default>>
					당신은 속옷 하의를 걸었다. <span class="purple">당신의 $worn.under_lower.name【이가】 벗겨져야 한다</span>.
				<</switch>>
				<br><br>

				<<link [[넘겨준다|Pub Dice Minigame]]>>
					<<switch $dice.event.clothingSlot>>
					<<case 0>>
						<<upperruined>><<lowerruined>>
					<<case 1>>
						<<upperruined>>
					<<case 2>>
						<<lowerruined>>
					<<case 3>>
						<<underupperruined>><<underlowerruined>>
					<<case 4>>
						<<underupperruined>>
					<<default>>
						<<underlowerruined>>
					<</switch>>
				<</link>>
				<br>

			<<elseif $dice.event.drinkEnabled>>
				누가 졌고 누가 이겼는지 집계한 뒤, 구경꾼 하나가 아무렇게나 고른 듯한 병을 집어 술을 따르기 시작한다. 잔마다 다른 병에서 따르고, 테이블의 모든 참가자 몫의 잔이 눈에 띄지 않는 쟁반에 놓여, 진 사람들에게 차례로 건네진다.
				<br><br>
				<<set _shotsRemaining to 4>>
				<<for _i to 1; _i lte 3; _i++>>
					<<if $dice.event.roundLoss[_i]>>
						지난 판에서 진 <<= "<<person"+_i+">>">><<person>>【이가】 잔 하나를 골라 술을 <<= either("털어 넣는다", "마신다", "벌컥 들이켠다")>>.
						<<set _shotsRemaining-->>
					<<else>>
						<<= "<<person"+_i+">>">><<person>>【은는】 지난 판에서 이겼다고 기뻐한다.
					<</if>>
					<br>
				<</for>>
				<br>
				<<if $dice.event.roundLoss[0]>>
					이제 당신이 잔을 고르고 술을 들이켤 차례다.
					<br><br>
					/* Rolled here, once the glasses the losers already took are accounted for */
					<<rng 1 _shotsRemaining>>
					<<for _i to 1; _i lte _shotsRemaining; _i++>>
						<<capture _i, $rng>>
							<<link [[#_i번 잔을 고른다|Pub Dice Minigame]]>>
								<<if $rng is _i and playerMayBeSpiked()>>
									<<drinkwatch>>
									<<if $drinkGuarded>>
										/* A sharp eye catches the undissolved grit at the bottom of the glass before it reaches your lips. */
										<<run $dice.log.push('<span class="green">그 잔 바닥에 뭔가 가라앉아 있다</span>. 당신은 잔을 내려놓고 다른 잔을 집는다.')>>
										<<run $dice.log.push('"Suit yourself," the <<person1>><<person>> says, a little too quickly.')>>
									<<else>>
										<<xchange-random-spike>><<xchange-seen 2>>
										<<if !$xchange.pill.genderflipEffect>><<xchange-addeffect "genderflip">><</if>>
										<<run $dice.log.push('<span class="purple">당신의 술에 뭔가 들어 있었다.</span>')>>
										<<if $xchange.pill.genderflipEffect>>
											<<set _comment to either(
												"솔직히 말해서, 이러니까 훨씬 보기 좋은데.",
												$player.sex is "f"? "꽤 귀여워졌는데, 응?":"꽤 잘생겨졌는데, 응?",
												"눈요깃거리가 필요하다고 생각하던 참이었는데.",
												"이제 꽤 재미있어지는데.",
												"오, 그래, 정말 끝내주는 엉덩이로군."
											)>>
										<<else>>
											/* The dose landed, but nothing about your body changed, so the table has nothing to gawk at. */
											<<set _comment to either(
												"아무 일도 없어? 좋은 알약 낭비했네.",
												"어라. 저건 뭔가 될 줄 알았는데.",
												"싸구려 쓰레기야, 저건. 또 바가지 썼군."
											)>>
										<</if>>
										<<run $dice.log.push('"Gahahaha!" the <<person1>><<person>> laughs. "'+_comment+'"')>>
									<</if>>
								<</if>>
								<<drunk `either(30,30,30,60,60,120,180)`>>
							<</link>><br>
						<</capture>>
					<</for>>
				<<else>>
					<<link [[다음|Pub Dice Minigame]]>><</link>>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>

		<<dice-clearevents>>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-clearevents">>
		<<set $dice.event.roundLoss to [0,0,0,0]>>
		<<unset $dice.event.kiss>>
		<<unset $dice.event.oral>>
		<<unset $dice.event.sex>>
		<<unset $dice.event.clothing>>
		<<unset $dice.event.clothingSlot>>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-display">>
		<table class="dice-grid">
			<thead>
				<tr>
					<th scope="col"></th>
					<th scope="col" class="text-center">당신</th>
					<th scope="col" class="text-center"><<silently>><<person1>><<person>><</silently>><<capitalise>></th>
					<th scope="col" class="text-center"><<silently>><<person2>><<person>><</silently>><<capitalise>></th>
					<th scope="col" class="text-center"><<silently>><<person3>><<person>><</silently>><<capitalise>></th>
				</tr>
			</thead>
			<tbody>
				<tr>
					<th scope="row">돈</th>
					<<for _money range $dice.money>>
						<td class="text-right"><<printmoney _money>></td>
					<</for>>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<th scope="row">현재 판돈</th>
					<<for _i, _bet range $dice.bets>>
						<<if $dice.altbet isnot undefined and _i is 0>>
							<td class="text-right"><span class="gold"><<set _text_output to $dice.altbet>><<capitalise>></span></td>
						<<else>>
							<td class="text-right"><<printmoney _bet>></td>
						<</if>>
					<</for>>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<th scope="row">입장</th>
					<<for _player to 0; _player lt 4; _player++>>
						<<if $dice.status[_player] isnot "Playing">>
							<td class="text-right"><span class="red">$dice.status[_player]</span></td>
						<<else>>
							<td class="text-right"><span @class="$dice.positions[_player] is 'Withdrew'? 'red': $dice.positions[_player] is 'Shooter'? 'teal' :'gold'">$dice.positions[_player]</span></td>
						<</if>>
					<</for>>
				</tr>
				<tr>
					<th score="row" class="dice-pot">승자의 판돈</th>
					<td colspan="4" class="text-center dice-pot"><b><<printmoney $dice.pot>></b></td>
				</tr>
			</tbody>
		</table>
		<br>

		<<if $phase gt 1>>
			<<if $dice.round.point>>
				<b><span class="dice-point"><span class="gold">포인트:</span> $dice.round.point</span></b>
				<br><br>
			<</if>>

			<<if $dice.values>>
				<img @src="'img/misc/prop/die-'+$dice.values[0]+'.png'">
				<img @src="'img/misc/prop/die-'+$dice.values[1]+'.png'">
			<<else>>
				<img src="img/misc/prop/die-roll.gif">
				<img src="img/misc/prop/die-roll.gif">
			<</if>>

			<<if $dice.values>>
				<<set _diceResult to $dice.values[0]+$dice.values[1]>>
				<span class="dice-result-text"><b> = _diceResult</b></span>
			<</if>>


			<<if $dice.positions[0] is "Withdrew">>
				<span class="dice-result-text"><b> | <span class="red">기권했다...</span></b></span>
			<<elseif $dice.shooter is 0 and $dice.round.result is "In Favour">>
				<span class="dice-result-text"><b> | <span class="green">당신이 이겼다!</span><<= $dice.positions.count("Against") lte 0?" (반대한 사람 없음)":"">></b></span>
			<<elseif $dice.shooter is 0 and $dice.round.result is "Against">>
				<span class="dice-result-text"><b> | <span class="red">당신이 졌다...</span></b></span>
			<<elseif $dice.round.result and $dice.positions[0] is $dice.round.result>>
				<span class="dice-result-text"><b> | <span class="green">당신이 이겼다!</span><<= $dice.positions.count("Against") lte 0?" (반대한 사람 없음)":"">></b></span>
			<<elseif $dice.round.result and $dice.positions[0] isnot $dice.round.result>>
				<span class="dice-result-text"><b> | <span class="red">당신이 졌다...</span><<= $dice.positions[$dice.shooter] is "Withdrew"?" (슈터가 기권함)":"">></b></span>
			<</if>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-betting-interface">>
		<table>
			<tbody>
			<tr>
				<th scope="row">
					<span class="gold">베팅 (£):</span>
				</th>
				<td style="width: 15px;"/>
				<td class="lblue">
					<<print formatMoney($dice.currentBet)>>+
				</td>
				<td>
					<<numberbox "_bet" 0>> 
				</td>
				<td>
					<mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>
					<<if $dice.shooter is 0>>
						현재 판돈을 이 금액만큼 올린다.
					<<else>>
						나머지 플레이어가 건 금액에 맞춘 뒤, 현재 판돈을 이 금액만큼 올린다.
					<</if>>
					<<dice-stake>>랜드리는 라운드당 <<printmoney _stake>>으로 테이블 한도를 정했고, 남은 한도는 <<printmoney `Math.max(0, _stake - $dice.currentBet)`>>이다.
					</span></mouse>
				</td>
			</tr>
			<<if $dice.shooter isnot 0 and $dice.positions[0] is "">>
				<tr>
					<th scope="row" class="gold">입장:</th>
					<td />
					<td class="lblue">베팅 </td>
					<td class="">
						<<if $dice.queue[1] isnot 0>>
							<<listbox "_position">>
								<<option "찬성" "In Favour">>
								<<option "반대" "Against">>
							<</listbox>>
						<<else>>
							<<listbox "_position">>
								<<option "반대" "Against">>
							<</listbox>>
							슈터에게 반대로 걸어야 한다.
						<</if>>
					</td>
					<td />
				</tr>
			<</if>>
			</tbody>
		</table>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-instructions">>
		<<foldout false "_diceInstructionsFoldout">>
			<span class="gold">게임 설명</span>
				<span class="blue">기본 규칙:</span>
				<ul>
					<li>게임은 라운드로 나뉜다.</li>
					<li>매 라운드마다 한 플레이어가 결과가 분명해질 때까지 주사위를 굴린다. 이 사람을 "슈터"라고 부른다.</li>
					<li>모든 플레이어가 돌아가며 "슈터"가 된다.</li>
					<li>"슈터"가 아닌 플레이어는 슈터에게 "찬성"하거나 "반대"하는 쪽에 걸어야 한다.</li>
					<li>다음에 "슈터"가 될 플레이어는 항상 현재 슈터에게 "반대"로 걸어야 한다.</li>
					<li>"슈터"가 이기면 "찬성"한 사람도 모두 이긴다. "슈터"가 지면 "반대"한 사람이 대신 이긴다.</li>
					<li>플레이어는 모두 라운드에 참여하려면 참가비를 먼저 내야 한다.</li>
					<li>라운드의 승자가 아직 정해지지 않았다면, 모든 플레이어("슈터" 포함)는 매 굴림 사이에 판돈을 올릴 수 있다.</li>
				</ul>
				<span class="blue">이기는 방법:</span>
				<ul>
					<li>슈터이거나 "찬성"에 걸었다면,</li>
					<ul>
						<li>라운드 첫 굴림에서 7 또는 11이 나오면 이긴다.</li>
					</ul>
					<li>"반대"에 걸었다면,</li>
					<ul>
						<li>슈터가 라운드 첫 굴림에서 2, 3 또는 12를 굴리면 이긴다.</li>
					</ul>
					<li>라운드 첫 굴림 이후에도 뚜렷한 승자가 없다면,</li>
					<ul>
						<li>첫 굴림에서 나온 숫자가 "포인트"가 된다.</li>
						<li>슈터는 "포인트"가 다시 나오거나 7이 나올 때까지 계속 굴린다.</li>
						<li>포인트가 다시 나오면 슈터가 이긴다("찬성"한 사람도 함께).</li>
						<li>슈터가 7을 굴리면 "반대"한 사람이 이긴다.</li>
					</ul>
				</ul>
				<span class="blue">추가 사항:</span>
				<ul>
					<li>"슈터"가 기권하면 "찬성"한 사람은 자동으로 라운드에서 진다.</li>
					<li>"반대"한 사람이 모두 기권하면 "슈터"(와 "찬성"한 사람)가 이긴다.</li>
					<li>라운드가 승자 없이 끝나면 모든 판돈은 원래 주인에게 돌아간다.</li>
				</ul>




				/* <li>All players must pay an ante upfront to play a round.</li>
				<li>Each round consists of the following stages:</li>
				<ul>
					<li>The Bet. In which players decide whether they'll bet with or against the shooter</li>
					<li>The "Come Out" roll. Which is the first roll, that may decide "the point" for subsequent rolls.</li>
					<li>The Subsequent rolls. The rolls that follow, until the shooter rolls a 7 or "the point".</li>
				</ul>
				<li>The "shooter" is the player currently rolling the dice. And they always make the first bet.</li>
				<li>The player to the right of the shooter must always bet 'Against'.</li>
				<li>On the first roll of their turn,
				<ul>
					<li>If the shooter rolls 7 or 11, then the shooter along with those who bet in favour win and divide the pot.</li>
					<li>If the shooter rolls 2, 3, or 12, the shooter loses, and those who bet against divide the pot.</li>
					<li>If the shooter rolls anything else, that number becomes "the point".</li>
				</ul>
				<li>On subsequent rolls of their turn,</li>
				<ul>
					<li>If the shooter rolls "the point", then the shooter along with those who bet in favour win and divide the pot.</li>
					<li>If the shooter rolls 7, the shooter loses, and those who bet against divide the pot.</li>
					<li>Otherwise, the shooter keeps rolling until "the point" or 7 come out.</li>
				</ul>
				<li>If the shooter wins or loses, the dice pass to the next player who now becomes the new shooter.</li> */
		<</foldout>>
		<br>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-roll">>
		<<set $dice.values to []>>
		<<set _gamblingLuck to $statFreeze ? 0 : (($daily.moorGamblingLuck ? 40 : 0) + ($daily.wrenDiceTip ? 10 : 0) + ($foodstuff.four_leaf_clover?.amount gte 1 ? 7 : 0))>>
		<<if _gamblingLuck gt 0 and ["Shooter", "In Favour", "Against"].includes($dice.positions[0]) and random(1, 100) lte _gamblingLuck>>
			<<if ["Shooter", "In Favour"].includes($dice.positions[0])>>
				<<set _luckyTotal to $dice.round.point === undefined ? 7 : $dice.round.point>>
			<<else>>
				<<set _luckyTotal to $dice.round.point === undefined ? 2 : 7>>
			<</if>>
			<<rng `Math.max(1, _luckyTotal - 6)` `Math.min(6, _luckyTotal - 1)`>>
			<<set $dice.values.push($rng, _luckyTotal - $rng)>>
		<<else>>
			<<rng 1 6>><<set $dice.values.push($rng)>>
			<<rng 1 6>><<set $dice.values.push($rng)>>
		<</if>>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-clear">>
		<<set $dice.values to undefined>>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-compute-result">>
		/* If shooter withdraws, opposition wins*/
		<<if $dice.positions[$dice.shooter] is "Withdrew">>
			<<set $dice.round.result to "Against">>
			<<exit>>
		<</if>>

		/* If all opposition to the shooter is gone, declare round in favour */
		<<if $dice.positions.count("Against") lte 0>>
			<<set $dice.round.result to "In Favour">>
			<<exit>>
		<</if>>

		/* Add dice results together */
		<<set _rollResult to $dice.values[0] + $dice.values[1]>>

		<<if $dice.round.point is undefined>> /* Come Out result */
			<<if [7,11].includes(_rollResult)>>
				<<set $dice.round.result to "In Favour">>
			<<elseif [2,3,12].includes(_rollResult)>>
				<<set $dice.round.result to "Against">>
			<<else>>
				<<set $dice.round.point to _rollResult>>
			<</if>>
		
		<<else>> /* Subsequent rolls result */
			<<if _rollResult is $dice.round.point>>	
				<<set $dice.round.result to "In Favour">>
			<<elseif _rollResult is 7>>
				<<set $dice.round.result to "Against">>
			<</if>>

		<</if>>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-compute-wagers">>
		<<set _initiative to _args[0]>>
		<<set _npcRaisingAllowed to _args[1]>>
		<<for _i, _player range $dice.queue>>
			<<capture _player>>
				<<if _player is 0 or $dice.status[_player] isnot "Playing" or $dice.positions[_player] is "Withdrew">>
					<<continue>> /* Skip betting in PC's name, or if NPC is no longer playing */
				<</if>>

				<!-- Assign betting positions for each NPCs if they have none -->
				<<if $dice.positions[_player] is "">>
					<<rng 0 1>><<set $dice.positions[_player] to _i is 1 or $rng is 1? "Against" : "In Favour">> <!-- Force at least one 'Against' position -->
				<</if>>

				<<if _initiative is "pc">> /* If PC raised the bet, match it */
					<<dice-match-bet _player>>

				<<elseif _initiative is "npc">> /* If NPCs can act first, consider matching. Then consider raising */
					<<dice-match-bet _player _npcRaisingAllowed>>

				<</if>>
			<</capture>>
		<</for>>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-match-bet">>
		<<set _player to _args[0]>>
		<<set _raisingAllowed to _args[1]>>
		/* Risk is judged against the full buy-in, not half of it */
		<<dice-stake>>

		<!-- Compute willingness to match current bet -->
		<<rng 1 10>><<set _foolish to $rng lte 3>>
		<<set _confidence to 800 + $NPCList[_player-1].skills.security - $dice.currentBet * 1000 / _stake + $dice.bets[_player] * 0.1 / ($dice.wagerLvl + 1)>>
		<<rng 1000>><<set _daresToMatchBet to _confidence gt $rng or _foolish>>
		<<set _raiseAmount to Math.min($dice.currentBet - $dice.bets[_player], $dice.money[_player])>>

		<<if _raiseAmount lte 0>>
			<!-- Consider raising the stakes if allowed -->
			<<if _raisingAllowed>>
				<<rng 1 10>><<set _greedy to $rng lte 3>>
				<<set _confidence to 500 + $NPCList[_player-1].skills.security - $dice.bets[$dice.shooter] * 1000 / _stake>>
				<<rng 1000>><<set _daresToRaise to _confidence gt $rng and _greedy>>

				<<if _daresToRaise>>
					<<set _wagerScale to [500,1000,3000][$dice.wagerLvl]>>
					<<set _wagerAmount to random(1,8)*_wagerScale>>
					<<dice-bet _player _wagerAmount>>
					<<run $dice.log.push("The <<person"+_player+">><<person>> raises the stake by <<printmoney "+_wagerAmount+">>.")>>
					<<dice-compute-wagers "npc" false>>
					<<exit>>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>

		<<elseif _daresToMatchBet>>
			<<dice-bet _player _raiseAmount>>
			<<if _raiseAmount gt 0>>
				<<run $dice.log.push("The <<person"+_player+">><<person>> matches the bet.")>>
			<</if>>

			<!-- Consider raising the stakes if allowed -->
			<<if _raisingAllowed>>
				<<rng 1 10>><<set _greedy to $rng lte 3>>
				<<set _confidence to 500 + $NPCList[_player-1].skills.security - $dice.bets[$dice.shooter] * 1000 / _stake>>
				<<rng 1000>><<set _daresToRaise to _confidence gt $rng and _greedy>>

				<<if _daresToRaise>>
					<<set _wagerScale to [500,1000,3000][$dice.wagerLvl]>>
					<<set _wagerAmount to random(1,8)*_wagerScale>>
					<<dice-bet _player _wagerAmount>>
					<<run $dice.log.push("The <<person"+_player+">><<person>> raises the stake by <<printmoney "+_wagerAmount+">>.")>>
					<<dice-compute-wagers "npc" false>>
					<<exit>>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>

		<<else>>
			<<set $dice.positions[_player] to "Withdrew">>
			<<run $dice.log.push("<span class='red'><<person"+_player+">><<person>>【이가】 기권했다.</span>")>>
		<</if>>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-bet">>
		<<set _player to _args[0]>> /* Index of player */
		<<set _amount to Math.max(0, _args[1])>> /* Amount to bet, floored so a negative input can't drain money into the player */

		/* Bet whatever remains if can't match the bet */
		<<if $dice.money[_player] lte _amount>><<set _amount to $dice.money[_player]>><</if>>

		<<set $dice.money[_player] -= _amount>>
		<<set $dice.bets[_player] += _amount>>
		<<set $dice.pot += _amount>>

		<<if $dice.currentBet lt $dice.bets[_player]>>
			<<set $dice.currentBet to $dice.bets[_player]>>
		<</if>>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-pc-bet">>
		<<dice-stake>>
		<<set _room to Math.max(0, _stake - $dice.currentBet)>>
		<<set _raise to Math.min(Math.max(0, Number(_args[0]) || 0) * 100, _room)>>
		<<dice-bet 0 `$dice.currentBet - $dice.bets[0] + _raise`>>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-endround">>
		/* Count winners */
		<<set _winnerCount to $dice.round.result is "In Favour"? 1 : 0>>
		<<for _player range [0,1,2,3]>>
			<<set _winnerCount += $dice.positions[_player] is $dice.round.result? 1 : 0>>
		<</for>>
		
		<<if _winnerCount is 0>> /* If nobody won, wagered amounts return to each player */
			<<for _player range [0,1,2,3]>>
				<<set $dice.money[_player] += $dice.bets[_player]>>
			<</for>>
			<<set $dice.pot to 0>> /* Without this, the refunded pot lingered and was added to on top of the next round's bets, letting a winner later get paid out money that had already been returned once. */

		<<else>>
			<<set _split to Math.floor($dice.pot / _winnerCount)>><<set $dice.pot to 0>>

			/* Reward the shooter if in favour */
			<<if $dice.round.result is "In Favour">>
				<<set $dice.money[$dice.shooter] += _split>>
				<<set $dice.event.roundLoss[$dice.shooter] to 0>>
				<<capture _split, $dice.bets>>
					<<set _gains to _split - $dice.bets[$dice.shooter]>>
					<<if $dice.shooter is 0>>
						<<run $dice.log.push("You won <<printmoney "+_gains+">>.")>>
					<<else>>
						<<run $dice.log.push("The <<person"+$dice.shooter+">><<person>> won <<printmoney "+_gains+">>.")>>
					<</if>>
				<</capture>>
			<<else>>
				<<set $dice.event.roundLoss[$dice.shooter] to 1>>
			<</if>>

			/* Reward the rest of the winners */
			<<for _player range [0,1,2,3]>>
				<<if $dice.positions[_player] is $dice.round.result>>
					<<set $dice.money[_player] += _split>>
					<<if _player isnot $dice.shooter>>
						<<set $dice.event.roundLoss[_player] to 0>>
					<</if>>
					<<capture _player, _split, $dice.bets>>
						<<set _gains to _split - $dice.bets[_player]>>
						<<if _player is 0>>
							<<run $dice.log.push("You won <<printmoney "+_gains+">>.")>>
						<<else>>
							<<run $dice.log.push("The <<person"+_player+">><<person>> won <<printmoney "+_gains+">>.")>>
						<</if>>
					<</capture>>
				<<else>>
					<<if _player isnot $dice.shooter>>
						<<set $dice.event.roundLoss[_player] to 1>>
					<</if>>
				<</if>>

			<</for>>
		<</if>>


		/* Run checks that trigger events on next round */
		<<dice-eventchecks>>

		/* Clean up round variables */
		<<set $dice.round.result to undefined>>
		<<set $dice.round.point to undefined>>
		<<set $dice.currentBet to 0>>
		<<set $dice.bets to [0,0,0,0]>>
		<<set $dice.altbet to undefined>>
		<<set $dice.altbetClothing to undefined>>
		<<set $dice.positions to ["","","",""]>>
		<<set $dice.values to undefined>>

		/* Prepare the next round */
		<<set $phase to 1>>
		<<run $dice.queue.shift()>> <!-- Advance the shooter queue -->
		<!-- Expel everyone who ran out of cash, covering the shooter shifted out above -->
		<<for _player range [1,2,3]>>
			<<if $dice.money[_player] lte 0>>
				<<set $dice.status[_player] to "Out">>
			<</if>>
		<</for>>
		<<run $dice.queue.deleteWith((value) => value isnot 0 and $dice.money[value] lte 0)>>
		<<if $dice.money[$dice.shooter] gt 0 or $dice.shooter is 0>> <!-- Do not re-add the shooter to queue if out of cash -->
			<<run $dice.queue.pushUnique($dice.shooter)>>
		<</if>>
		<<set $dice.shooter to $dice.queue.first()>>
		<<set $dice.positions[$dice.shooter] to "Shooter">>
	<</widget>>

	<<widget "dice-endgame">>
		<<set $money += $dice.money[0]>>
		<<unset $dice>>
		<<set $daily.dicegame to 1>>
		<<endevent>>
	<</widget>>

:: Pub Dice Minigame
	<<effects>>

	<<if $diceintro>>
		<<generate1>><<generate2>><<generate3>>
		
		<<dice-stake $wagerLvl>><<set _playerMoney to _stake>>
		<<set $dice to {
			wagerLvl: $wagerLvl, /* Every other stake number is derived from this by <<dice-stake>>, so nothing can desync from it */
			pot: 0,
			shooter: 0, /* Index of player that's currently the shooter */
			values: undefined, /* Houses the results of the two dice. */
			queue: [0,1,2,3], /* The shooter queue, using player indices. The first one is always the shooter */
			money: [_playerMoney,_playerMoney,_playerMoney,_playerMoney],
			positions: ["Shooter", "", "", ""],
			status: ["Playing","Playing","Playing","Playing"],
			currentBet: 0,
			bets: [0,0,0,0],
			altbet: undefined,
			altbetClothing: undefined, /* Slot code (0-5) of a garment being wagered, mirrors $phase in Docks Sacrifice */
			altbetcount: 0,
			round: {
				point: undefined,
				result: undefined,
			},
			log: [],
			event: {
				pending: 0,
				roundLoss: [0,0,0,0],
				roundsUntilAlcohol: random(2,4),
				drinkIntro: 0,
				drinkEnabled: 0,
			}
		}>>
		<<unset $diceintro>>
		<<unset $wagerLvl>>
	<</if>>


	<<switch $phase>>
	<<case 1>> /* Opening Bets */

		<<dice-log>>
		<<dice-runevents>>

		<<if !$dice.event.pending>>
			<<dice-display>>
			<<if $dice.queue.length lte 1>>
				다른 플레이어는 모두 탈락했다.
			<<elseif $dice.money[0] gte 2000>>
				<<link [[이번 라운드를 한다 (£20)|Pub Dice Minigame Wager]]>><<set $dicewagerintro to 1>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				돈이 바닥났다.
				<<if $dice.altbetcount lt 3>>
					<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 2)>>
						<br>
						<<link [[키스를 걸고 라운드를 한다|Pub Dice Minigame Wager]]>>
							<<set $dicewagerintro to 1>>
							<<set $dice.altbet to "a kiss">>
							<<set $dice.altbetcount++>>
							<<promiscuity2>>
						<</link>><<promiscuous2>>
					<</if>>
					<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 4)>>
						<br>
						<<link [[오럴을 걸고 라운드를 한다|Pub Dice Minigame Wager]]>>
							<<set $dicewagerintro to 1>>
							<<set $dice.altbet to "an oral">>
							<<set $dice.altbetcount++>>
							<<promiscuity4>>
						<</link>><<promiscuous4>>
					<</if>>
					<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 5)>>
						<br>
						<<link [[몸을 걸고 라운드를 한다|Pub Dice Minigame Wager]]>>
							<<set $dicewagerintro to 1>>
							<<set $dice.altbet to "your body">>
							<<set $dice.altbetcount++>>
							<<promiscuity5>>
						<</link>><<promiscuous5>>
					<</if>>

					/* Wager an article of clothing instead. 
					Choosing which garment to stake reuses the same set/naked checks as the Docks false-trail "Sacrifice" menu.
					If the round is lost, the staked garment is ruined exactly like the dock sacrifice. */
					<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 1)>>
						<<if $worn.upper.set is $worn.lower.set>>
							<<if $worn.upper.name isnot "naked">>
								<br>
								<<clothingicon $worn.upper "upper">><<link [[옷 한 벌 전체를 걸고 라운드를 한다|Pub Dice Minigame Wager]]>>
									<<set $dicewagerintro to 1>>
									<<set $dice.altbet to "your outfit">>
									<<set $dice.altbetClothing to 0>>
									<<set $dice.altbetcount++>>
								<</link>>
							<</if>>
						<<else>>
							<<if $worn.upper.name isnot "naked">>
								<br>
								<<clothingicon $worn.upper "upper">><<link [[상의를 걸고 라운드를 한다|Pub Dice Minigame Wager]]>>
									<<set $dicewagerintro to 1>>
									<<set $dice.altbet to "your top">>
									<<set $dice.altbetClothing to 1>>
									<<set $dice.altbetcount++>>
								<</link>>
							<</if>>
							<<if $worn.lower.name isnot "naked">>
								<br>
								<<clothingicon $worn.lower "lower">><<link [[하의를 걸고 라운드를 한다|Pub Dice Minigame Wager]]>>
									<<set $dicewagerintro to 1>>
									<<set $dice.altbet to "your bottoms">>
									<<set $dice.altbetClothing to 2>>
									<<set $dice.altbetcount++>>
								<</link>>
							<</if>>
						<</if>>
						<<if $worn.under_upper.set is $worn.under_lower.set>>
							<<if $worn.under_upper.name isnot "naked">>
								<br>
								<<clothingicon $worn.under_upper "under_upper">><<link [[속옷 한 벌을 걸고 라운드를 한다|Pub Dice Minigame Wager]]>>
									<<set $dicewagerintro to 1>>
									<<set $dice.altbet to "your under outfit">>
									<<set $dice.altbetClothing to 3>>
									<<set $dice.altbetcount++>>
								<</link>>
							<</if>>
						<<else>>
							<<if $worn.under_upper.name isnot "naked">>
								<br>
								<<clothingicon $worn.under_upper "under_upper">><<link [[속옷 상의를 걸고 라운드를 한다|Pub Dice Minigame Wager]]>>
									<<set $dicewagerintro to 1>>
									<<set $dice.altbet to "your under top">>
									<<set $dice.altbetClothing to 4>>
									<<set $dice.altbetcount++>>
								<</link>>
							<</if>>
							<<if $worn.under_lower.name isnot "naked">>
								<br>
								<<clothingicon $worn.under_lower "under_lower">><<link [[속옷 하의를 걸고 라운드를 한다|Pub Dice Minigame Wager]]>>
									<<set $dicewagerintro to 1>>
									<<set $dice.altbet to "your underwear">>
									<<set $dice.altbetClothing to 5>>
									<<set $dice.altbetcount++>>
								<</link>>
							<</if>>
						<</if>>
					<</if>>
				<<else>>
					게다가 걸 수 있는 특별한 호의도 바닥났다.
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
			<br>
			<<link [[그만둔다|Pub Dice Minigame End]]>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>

	<<case 2>> /* Roll Results (Win / Lose - Point Discovery) */

		<<dice-compute-result>>
		<<dice-log>>
		<<dice-display>>

		<<if $dice.round.result>>
			<<link [[다음 라운드|Pub Dice Minigame]]>><<dice-endround>><</link>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[다음|Pub Dice Minigame Wager]]>><<dice-clear>><<set $wagerstage to 3>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>

	<</switch>>

	<br>
	<<if !$dice.event.pending>>
		<<dice-instructions>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $dice.event.pending to 0>>

:: Pub Dice Minigame Wager

	/* Initialization */
	<<if $dicewagerintro>> 
		<<set _favoursValueMap to {
			"a kiss": 2000,
			"an oral": 5000,
			"your body": 20000,
			"your outfit": 4000,
			"your top": 2000,
			"your bottoms": 2000,
			"your under outfit": 2000,
			"your under top": 1000,
			"your underwear": 1000
		}>>
		<<for _player range $dice.queue>>
			<<if $dice.altbet isnot undefined>>
				<<dice-bet _player `_favoursValueMap[$dice.altbet]*(1+$dice.wagerLvl)`>>
			<<else>>
				<<dice-bet _player 2000>>
			<</if>>
			<<capture _player>>
				<<if _player isnot 0>>
					<<run $dice.log.push("The <<person"+_player+">><<person>> joins this round.")>>
				<<elseif $dice.altbet isnot undefined>>
					<<run $dice.log.push('<span class="lewd">당신은 이번 판에 참여한다. 건 것: '+({"a kiss":"키스","an oral":"구강 봉사","your body":"당신의 몸","your outfit":"당신의 옷 전부","your top":"당신의 윗옷","your bottoms":"당신의 아래옷","your under outfit":"당신의 속옷 세트","your under top":"당신의 속옷 윗부분","your underwear":"당신의 속옷"}[$dice.altbet] || $dice.altbet)+", 값어치는</span> <<printmoney "+(_favoursValueMap[$dice.altbet]*(1+$dice.wagerLvl))+">>.")>>
				<</if>>
			<</capture>>
		<</for>>
		<<unset $dicewagerintro>>
		<<set $wagerstage to 1>>
	<</if>>

	<<if $wagerstage is 1>> /* Initial Bet - Shooter bets first */
		
		<<dice-compute-wagers "npc" true>>
		
		<<dice-log>>
		<<dice-display>>
		
		<<if $dice.shooter is 0>>
			<<dice-betting-interface>>

			<<link [[확정한다 (0:02)|Pub Dice Minigame Wager]]>>
				<<set $wagerstage to 2>>
				<<set $phase to 2>>
				<<dice-pc-bet _bet>>
				<<dice-compute-wagers "pc">>
				<<pass 2>>
			<</link>>
			<br>
			<<dice-stake>>
			<<if _stake gt $dice.currentBet and $dice.money[0] gt 0>>
				<<link [[최대 판돈으로 확정한다 (0:02)|Pub Dice Minigame Wager]]>>
					<<set $wagerstage to 2>>
					<<set $phase to 2>>
					<<dice-pc-bet Infinity>>
					<<dice-compute-wagers "pc">>
					<<pass 2>>
				<</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>

		<<else>>
			<<dice-betting-interface>>

			<<link [[확정한다 (0:02)|Pub Dice Minigame Wager]]>>
				<<set $wagerstage to 2>>
				<<set $phase to 2>>
				<<dice-pc-bet _bet>>
				<<set $dice.positions[0] to _position>>
				<<if _bet gt 0>><<dice-compute-wagers "pc">><</if>>
				<<pass 2>>
			<</link>>
			<br>
			<<dice-stake>>
			<<if _stake gt $dice.currentBet and $dice.money[0] gt 0>>
				<<link [[최대 판돈으로 확정한다 (0:02)|Pub Dice Minigame Wager]]>>
					<<set $wagerstage to 2>>
					<<set $phase to 2>>
					<<dice-pc-bet Infinity>>
					<<set $dice.positions[0] to _position>>
					<<dice-compute-wagers "pc">>
					<<pass 2>>
				<</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>

	<<elseif $wagerstage is 2>> /* Confirmation of Pot / NPCs match current bet */

		<<dice-log>>
		이제 모든 판돈이 들어왔다...<br>

		<<dice-display>>
		<br>

		<<if $dice.shooter is 0>>
			<<link [[굴린다 (0:02)|Pub Dice Minigame]]>>
				<<dice-roll>><<pass 2>>
			<</link>>
		<<else>>
			슈터가 곧 주사위를 굴린다.
			<br>
			<<link [[다음 (0:02)|Pub Dice Minigame]]>>
				<<dice-roll>><<pass 2>>
			<</link>>
		<</if>>
		<br>

	<<elseif $wagerstage is 3>> /* Raise the stakes after first roll? */

		<<dice-compute-wagers "npc" true>>

		<<dice-log>>
		모두의 시선이 <<= $dice.shooter is 0? "당신": "슈터">>에게 쏠려 있다. 하나하나의 움직임을 놓치지 않고 지켜본다.<br>
		
		<<dice-display>>
		<<dice-betting-interface>>

		<<if $dice.bets[0] eq $dice.currentBet>>
			<<if $dice.shooter is 0>>
				<<link [[굴린다 (0:02)|Pub Dice Minigame]]>>
					<<dice-roll>><<pass 2>>
				<</link>>
			<<else>>
				슈터가 곧 주사위를 굴린다.
				<br>
				<<link [[다음 (0:02)|Pub Dice Minigame]]>>
					<<dice-roll>><<pass 2>>
				<</link>>
			<</if>>
			<br>
			<<link [[판돈을 올린다 (0:02)|Pub Dice Minigame Wager]]>>
				<<set $wagerstage to 2>>
				<<set $phase to 2>>
				<<dice-pc-bet _bet>>
				<<if _bet gt 0>><<dice-compute-wagers "pc">><</if>>
				<<pass 2>>
			<</link>>
			<br>
			<<dice-stake>>
			<<if _stake gt $dice.currentBet and $dice.money[0] gt 0>>
				<<link [[판돈을 최대로 올린다 (0:02)|Pub Dice Minigame Wager]]>>
					<<set $wagerstage to 2>>
					<<set $phase to 2>>
					<<dice-pc-bet Infinity>>
					<<dice-compute-wagers "pc">>
					<<pass 2>>
				<</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[확정한다 (0:02)|Pub Dice Minigame Wager]]>>
				<<set $wagerstage to 2>>
				<<set $phase to 2>>
				<<dice-pc-bet _bet>>
				<<if _bet gt 0>><<dice-compute-wagers "pc">><</if>>
				<<pass 2>>
			<</link>>
			<br>
			<<dice-stake>>
			<<if _stake gt $dice.currentBet and $dice.money[0] gt 0>>
				<<link [[최대 판돈으로 확정한다 (0:02)|Pub Dice Minigame Wager]]>>
					<<set $wagerstage to 2>>
					<<set $phase to 2>>
					<<dice-pc-bet Infinity>>
					<<dice-compute-wagers "pc">>
					<<pass 2>>
				<</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
			<<if $dice.shooter isnot 0>>
				<<link [[기권한다 (0:05)|Pub Dice Minigame]]>>
					<<set $dice.positions[0] to "Withdrew">>
					<<for $dice.round.result is undefined>>
						<<dice-roll>><<dice-compute-result>>
					<</for>>
					<<pass 5>>
				<</link>>
				<br>
			<<else>>
				<<link [[기권한다 (0:05)|Pub Dice Minigame]]>>
					<<set $dice.positions[0] to "Withdrew">>
					<<pass 5>>
				<</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>

	<<else>>
		버그입니다. 이곳에 있어서는 안 됩니다. 제보해 주십시오.
		<<run console.error(`Betting Stage: {$wagerstage}`)>>
	<</if>>
	<br>

	<<dice-instructions>>

